{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>והיה [and it shall come to pass].</b> אשר יהיה שם [that shall be there], like היה, and likewise אז ישיר משה (Exodus 15:1), יעשו עגל (Psalms 106:19)." "<b>For briars and thorns.</b> Kinds of thorns, and the meaning is that the camps of Assyria destroyed the land year after year."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:52:40.578767079Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}